ation abilities; the assessment relies on indirect hints. It is unclear how B\u2019s tone issues manifest in real crew settings, and whether any of the other candidates might actually possess strong teamwork that is not captured in the available data.\n**What would change my vote:**\u202fIf another agent can provide concrete positive evidence of teamwork/crew\u2011cooperation for A, C, or D, or if B\u2019s communication flaws are shown to have caused operational problems, I would reconsider.\nMETADATA_JSON:\n{\"agent\": \"agent_2\", \"vote\": \"Candidate B\"}"}
