tability, but they are outweighed by his proven reliability and positive crew atmosphere, which the other candidates do not demonstrably possess.\n**Remaining uncertainty:**\n- How C\u2019s communication challenges will manifest over extended missions and whether his reluctance to further education will hinder adaptation to new procedures or technology.\n**What would change my vote:**\n- Concrete, positive evidence that A, B, or D demonstrate strong teamwork/crew\u2011cooperation that outweighs their interpersonal flaws, or any indication that C\u2019s communication problems have led to safety\u2011critical incidents.\nMETADATA_JSON:\n{\"agent\": \"agent_1\", \"vote\": \"Candidate C\"}"}
